+/**
+ * Words for the requesting agent around an approval-gated command, from an
+ * installed surface. Both are optional: with none installed, or when one
+ * returns undefined or throws, dispatch keeps its own text.
+ *   - `pending`: told to the agent when its command is held for a card (who
